OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 DEC
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,6,     Gcelebrates its 90th anniversary
OL,7,     Gwith music by Grieg, Tippett and
OL,8,     GAyanna Witter-Johnson, with the
OL,9,     Ghelp of pianist Sir Stephen Hough.
OL,10,G2200FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,11,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,12,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,13,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,14,     GTonight, the "diva of the diode"
OL,15,     GSuzanne Ciani.
OL,16,G2215FNight Tracks
OL,17,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,18,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,19,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,20,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,21,     Geverything in between.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
