OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 DEC
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GRounding off his week, Venna
OL,6,     Gchooses to spotlight a release by
OL,7,     Ga saxophonist and producer that
OL,8,     Ghe has long been influenced by.
OL,9,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,10,     GThe Hungarian Radio Symphony
OL,11,     GOrchestra, Budapest plays
OL,12,     GMahler's tumultuous fifth
OL,13,     Gsymphony. In the first half of
OL,14,     Gthe concert Agnes Langer plays
OL,15,     GMozart's fourth violin concerto.
